<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RTRS-Cricket-Australia score 319 for 3 in 50 overs vs Boland.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cricket-Australia score 319 for 3 in 50 overs vs Boland.</headline>
<dateline>PAARL, South Africa 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia scored 319 for three off their 50 overs in the day/night match against Boland on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Australia</p>
<p>    M.Taylor c Jackson b Truter	     56</p>
<p>    M.Waugh retired			    101</p>
<p>    M.Bevan not out			     80</p>
<p>    J.Langer c Vorster b Albanie	    57</p>
<p>    G.Blewett not out			   15</p>
<p>    Extras (lb-3 w-6 nb-1)		    10</p>
<p>Total (for three wickets, 50 overs)  319</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-155 2-174 3-278</p>
<p>Did not bat: M.Hayden, M.Elliott, P.Reiffel, S.Warne, J.Gillespie, G.McGrath</p>
<p>Bowling: Telemachus 10-1-65-0 , Albanie 10-0-65-1, Jackson 5-0-40-0, Vorster 10-0-45-0, Truter 9-0-58-1, Kuiper 6-0-43-0</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
